    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Onikura</strong> is a 2D Plataformer Boss-Rush game focused on giving the player freedom to play and advance with their own style, giving you varied options to improve your character and unique abilities that completely change your play style. With unique scenarios and soundtracks, it has very challenging combat and boss fights that will stay with you forever. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022\u00a0<strong>A Hollow Knight-style Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parry, slash, heal, specials and more in a Hollow Knight-style combat with difficult and breathtaking boss fights, customizing your path during the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022\u00a0<strong>Combat features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parry</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008640/extras/953421f1f4a5656091bbf4b013210dbf.poster.avif?t=1731434166\" width=594 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008640/extras/953421f1f4a5656091bbf4b013210dbf.webm?t=1731434166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008640/extras/953421f1f4a5656091bbf4b013210dbf.mp4?t=1731434166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Specials</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008640/extras/815bb76d0584a651b7cc2f6787f6fad0.poster.avif?t=1731434166\" width=594 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008640/extras/815bb76d0584a651b7cc2f6787f6fad0.webm?t=1731434166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008640/extras/815bb76d0584a651b7cc2f6787f6fad0.mp4?t=1731434166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talismans</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008640/extras/42b2e1890e0fe18a27b5d9cf59480b72.poster.avif?t=1731434166\" width=594 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008640/extras/42b2e1890e0fe18a27b5d9cf59480b72.webm?t=1731434166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008640/extras/42b2e1890e0fe18a27b5d9cf59480b72.mp4?t=1731434166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008640/extras/bf9588bb5cee039e9c1223f5c5a825cc.poster.avif?t=1731434166\" width=594 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008640/extras/bf9588bb5cee039e9c1223f5c5a825cc.webm?t=1731434166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008640/extras/bf9588bb5cee039e9c1223f5c5a825cc.mp4?t=1731434166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022\u00a0<strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Japan's last hope, defeat all the Onis with the power you possess and seal their souls in the great sacred tree to bring about an era of peace once more.<br>Absorb the souls of your enemies and use their powers to eliminate each one of them until you reach the Oni God!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Onikura</strong> is a 2D Plataformer Boss-Rush game focused on giving the player freedom to play and advance with their own style, giving you varied options to improve your character and unique abilities that completely change your play style. With unique scenarios and soundtracks, it has very challenging combat and boss fights that will stay with you forever. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022\u00a0<strong>A Hollow Knight-style Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parry, slash, heal, specials and more in a Hollow Knight-style combat with difficult and breathtaking boss fights, customizing your path during the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022\u00a0<strong>Combat features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parry</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008640/extras/953421f1f4a5656091bbf4b013210dbf.poster.avif?t=1731434166\" width=594 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008640/extras/953421f1f4a5656091bbf4b013210dbf.webm?t=1731434166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008640/extras/953421f1f4a5656091bbf4b013210dbf.mp4?t=1731434166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Specials</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008640/extras/815bb76d0584a651b7cc2f6787f6fad0.poster.avif?t=1731434166\" width=594 height=24